The [[Corsair Commander (dervish)|Corsair Commander]] is a [[dervish]] boss within the Dajkah Inlet mission. It can spawn from the second lap onwards.

They later reappear as regular dervish/[[paragon]] enemies during a few [[Winds of Change]] quests. 

